<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    Deliberately empty.

    Domain has ZERO package references, which is the point of the innermost Onion ring: it depends on
    nothing and nothing about it changes when the database does. It previously referenced
    MongoDB.Driver so that BaseEntity and the value objects could carry [BsonId] /
    [BsonRepresentation] attributes — persistence concerns leaking into the domain model. Mapping now
    lives entirely in Persistence/Configurations as IEntityTypeConfiguration classes.

    If you find yourself adding a PackageReference here, the type probably belongs in Application.
  -->

</Project>
